      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Better to have an explicit conversion from strings and path objects.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "(though obviously too bad no nice one step convert between std::filesystem:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "attrs" : {
                        "id" : "1f61b",
                        "shortName" : ":stuck_out_tongue:",
                        "text" : "😛"
                     },
                     "type" : "emoji"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "ath and Characters::String).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "But I wrote converter functions which are OK (ToPath, FromPath).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "This is mostly easy excpet it will break alot of code (need ToPath calls added). Maybe should be called AsPath but then wouldnt match the From case).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
